  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks and place on a lined oven tray. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925478947f254b51716912/step-a9881600.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925478947f254b51716912/step-08f34c10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain and rinse chickpeas. Roughly chop tomato.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tomato and chickpeas until softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Add another drizzle of olive oil. Add ginger paste, Mumbai spice blend and masala spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add coconut milk and the water (for the curry). Reduce heat to low and simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Remove from heat and stir through roast veggies. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925478947f254b51716912/step-465b2320.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide butter rice between bowls.\n• Top with roast veggie and chickpea masala curry to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925478947f254b51716912/step-f82c4830.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
